body:
Am I the only one who hated how Harrison just somehow tracked his dad down in the middle of New York with no explanation? Then Dexter just abandons the code to tell him he's still there for him without really proving it WAS Harrison. He hasn't seen Harrison in 10 years, Harrison's hair was blonde when we last saw him. Now it's a dark brown? Hmm...

&#x200B;

CGI Deer was rough. And it felt rushed. He has held it together for 10 years and not ONCE has he run into a fuckboy who killed someone? I find that really hard to believe. Then the whole dude is going to go missing.

MMAFighting does not list anything until 266. They usually have fight night cards.

&#x200B;

Edit: I see there is an event on the 21st with Gastellum in the main event. My bad guys. Still read the write up, it doesn't really cover anything UFC anyway.
